        "pkcontributionId": 64240,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 289,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Squamous cell carcinoma (SCC), HPV-independent, is an HPV-independent squamous tumour with stromal invasion and/or exophytic-type invasion.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-04-28T14:54:33"
      }
    ],
